  "answer": "Since Light fares include free seat selection, you will be assigned a seat at check-in. You do not need to select a seat in advance. However, if you wish to choose a specific seat, you can do so during check-in or through the Corvina Airways website/app. Keep in mind that seat selection is free for Light passengers, but you cannot purchase extra legroom or exit row seats with Light fares. Your seat will be assigned automatically once you check in for your flight.",
